      "card_ids": ["C21","C43","C30","C07","C15","C39","C28","C42","C06","C10","C23","C14"]
    },
    {
      "claim": "L6 hepatic-clearance records are mostly not applicable to the query (mephenytoin CYP2C19 variants C86/C87/C90/C93/C94/C95, imipramine microsome solvent control C89, metabolite stability C92, mephenytoin S/R ratio C96). The only structurally related record, compound 28, shows human hepatocyte CLint 11 µL/min/10^6 cells (C97) and mouse CLint 67 (C88/C91); this indicates some metabolic turnover but is not a direct F measurement and does not establish F<20% for the query.",
      "card_ids": ["C86","C87","C88","C89","C90","C91","C92","C93","C94","C95","C96","C97"]
    }
  ],
  "new_evidence_assessment": [
